      ],
      "impact": "If both microcontrollers are populated, they will both attempt to drive the same I/O lines (PWM, SDA, SCK, etc.) and share the same ISP programming interface, leading to bus contention, unpredictable behavior, and potential damage. The board will not function as a single ATtiny fan controller.",
